{
    "title": "Parts Pass",
    "description": "The new way to order quality car parts online at wholesale pricing.\r\nWithin seconds, you will be able to search and find the right product you need from our inventory of over 3 million car parts! \r\n\r\nIt\u2019s time to take charge\u2013 the power of the Parts Pass App is now in your hands!\r\n\r\nBUILT FOR EVERYONE\r\nParts Pass was created for everyone, whether you grew up in the shop with your dad or you just get lost when it comes to cars and all their \u201clingo\u201d. With our straightforward design and easy navigation, you can get the right parts, at the right time, and for the best price.\r\n\r\nNEWEST TECHNOLOGY\r\nWith a simple snap of a photo, our A.I. technology helps decode your Make and Model to make sure you only see the parts you need. Search from over 1 million auto parts and manage your entire family by adding different vehicles on the app.\r\n\r\nPRICES YOU WILL LOVE\r\nHeading to a parts store or dealership to get your vehicle fixed can mean extra costs you don\u2019t need to pay. Shopping with Parts Pass means you can count on only new, quality name-brand parts at wholesale prices.\r\n\r\nFAST SHIPPING\r\nGet your car part delivered directly to you or your auto shop with next-day shipping.\r\n\r\nSUPERIOR CUSTOMER SERVICE\r\nWe care about you! This means we\u2019re here to make sure you get exactly what you need, every time.\r\n\r\nDownload the Parts Pass App today for free and rock your auto part search!\r\n\r\nBe a part of the team\u2013 Follow us on social:\r\n\r\nInstagram: www.instagram.com/partspass/\r\nFacebook: www.facebook.com/PartsPass\r\nYoutube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7icJJe7itEyK4RVbxhKOSA\r\nTikTok: www.tiktok.com/@partspass",
    "descriptionHTML": "The new way to order quality car parts online at wholesale pricing.<br>Within seconds, you will be able to search and find the right product you need from our inventory of over 3 million car parts! <br><br>It\u2019s time to take charge\u2013 the power of the Parts Pass App is now in your hands!<br><br>BUILT FOR EVERYONE<br>Parts Pass was created for everyone, whether you grew up in the shop with your dad or you just get lost when it comes to cars and all their \u201clingo\u201d. With our straightforward design and easy navigation, you can get the right parts, at the right time, and for the best price.<br><br>NEWEST TECHNOLOGY<br>With a simple snap of a photo, our A.I. technology helps decode your Make and Model to make sure you only see the parts you need. Search from over 1 million auto parts and manage your entire family by adding different vehicles on the app.<br><br>PRICES YOU WILL LOVE<br>Heading to a parts store or dealership to get your vehicle fixed can mean extra costs you don\u2019t need to pay. Shopping with Parts Pass means you can count on only new, quality name-brand parts at wholesale prices.<br><br>FAST SHIPPING<br>Get your car part delivered directly to you or your auto shop with next-day shipping.<br><br>SUPERIOR CUSTOMER SERVICE<br>We care about you! This means we\u2019re here to make sure you get exactly what you need, every time.<br><br>Download the Parts Pass App today for free and rock your auto part search!<br><br>Be a part of the team\u2013 Follow us on social:<br><br>Instagram: www.instagram.com/partspass/<br>Facebook: www.facebook.com/PartsPass<br>Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7icJJe7itEyK4RVbxhKOSA<br>TikTok: www.tiktok.com/@partspass",
